                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fdb065c5-744a-38e5-88f3-f2f29ece9a9c",
                        "entry_id": "5d301dba-81ba-31db-aea9-dfb1ed5c9639",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een man die veel vrouwen verleidt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e4c14fc-e9dc-4be5-a543-1b1565f78ffe",
                                "sense_id": "fdb065c5-744a-38e5-88f3-f2f29ece9a9c",
                                "text": "Dat Trump, een ongelovige vrouwenversierder, het bij de ethisch conservatieve Republikeinen even goed deed als George Bush was niet vanzelfsprekend."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "650eb2b5-3f3b-43c1-81c0-b5cfe79fc9eb",
                                "sense_id": "fdb065c5-744a-38e5-88f3-f2f29ece9a9c",
                                "text": "Het was niet bepaald een jongensdroom om in Hollywood aan de slag te gaan. \"Klopt, maar toen ik er eenmaal kennis mee had gemaakt, wilde ik niets anders meer,\" zegt Rudd, die met Clueless opeens ook als een seksidool werd beschouwd. Daar kan de keurig getrouwde vader van twee kinderen - de 10-jarige Jack en de 5-jarige Darby - zich niet meer in herkennen. \"Het was bizar om mee te maken, maar ik heb daarna geen echte vrouwenversierders meer gespeeld.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a04fc39a-6075-4f35-8557-503c7eed8571",
                                "sense_id": "fdb065c5-744a-38e5-88f3-f2f29ece9a9c",
                                "text": "Velen van ons kennen Casanova met name als een vermaard vrouwenversierder en dat was hij ook, laat daar geen twijfel over bestaan. Hij had langs de feministische meetlat van Cisca Dresselhuys een bedroevend figuur geslagen, vrees ik. Maar als we hem alleen maar als een rokkenjager zien, zouden we hem schromelijk tekortdoen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fa6edef3-1c58-480a-8916-445a177ef4ff",
                        "source_entry_id": "5d301dba-81ba-31db-aea9-dfb1ed5c9639",
                        "source_sense_id": "fdb065c5-744a-38e5-88f3-f2f29ece9a9c",
                        "source_sense_description": "een man die veel vrouwen verleidt",
                        "target_lang_word": "Weiberheld",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Weiberheld",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a12805a-6824-3a51-ba2f-59b5df892266",
                                        "entry_id": "7d5fccc3-b71c-3351-a46b-bc6c8a4ee6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mann, der bei Frauen besonders gut ankommt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbaca8b1-f2cd-49b0-b0fe-f8bf9cc69104",
                                                "sense_id": "0a12805a-6824-3a51-ba2f-59b5df892266",
                                                "text": "„Nur er, Max Barabander, der notorische Weiberheld, war immer noch allein.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f00a7a1d-3c09-4d49-8c64-4ef2e7aee5f7",
                                                "sense_id": "0a12805a-6824-3a51-ba2f-59b5df892266",
                                                "text": "„Er war ein Taugenichts, ein Trunkenbold und Weiberheld, entstammte einer Bauernfamilie aus der Pikardie und konnte nur sehr schlecht schreiben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8aa560e-1c00-49b3-8b8f-3590b3cde6cb",
                                                "sense_id": "0a12805a-6824-3a51-ba2f-59b5df892266",
                                                "text": "„Er war ein Weiberheld und ging an jedem Weib zugrunde.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a62bc480-086c-4d51-bc20-9494d143a5d7",
                        "source_entry_id": "5d301dba-81ba-31db-aea9-dfb1ed5c9639",
                        "source_sense_id": "fdb065c5-744a-38e5-88f3-f2f29ece9a9c",
                        "source_sense_description": "een man die veel vrouwen verleidt",
                        "target_lang_word": "Frauenheld",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Frauenheld",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d10cf60d-c2ea-3025-9dd6-7dc7f54127b4",
                                        "entry_id": "59b440e5-c590-3d51-860c-689302b9ccd7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mann, der bei Frauen besonders gut ankommt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e05246a2-119d-4fc3-94dc-9b984c86a50b",
                                                "sense_id": "d10cf60d-c2ea-3025-9dd6-7dc7f54127b4",
                                                "text": "„Wobei das Wort für ›Huhn‹, galinha, nicht, wie etwa chicken im Englischen (›Don't be a chicken about it!‹), für ›Memme‹, sondern, etwas überraschend, trotz des weiblichen a galinha, für einen Mann steht, der hinter den Frauen her ist, den Schürzenjäger oder Frauenheld.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7332d82f-e558-4d10-be35-d8630f3aa919",
                                                "sense_id": "d10cf60d-c2ea-3025-9dd6-7dc7f54127b4",
                                                "text": "„Das sind die schrecklichsten Augenblicke im Leben eines Frauenhelden; etwas Grausameres gibt es nicht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f627d445-b86d-4096-8467-52e2b47b4728",
                                                "sense_id": "d10cf60d-c2ea-3025-9dd6-7dc7f54127b4",
                                                "text": "„Sie passen nur so schön zu den Klischees, die ohnehin schon über den Lebemann, Frauenheld und Trinker kursieren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5239fcd0-2b8d-46e4-9194-d3b3d81cec7f",
                                                "sense_id": "d10cf60d-c2ea-3025-9dd6-7dc7f54127b4",
                                                "text": "„Ersterer sei ein Frauenheld, Letztere ein Flittchen im Ansehen der meisten Leute, die dumme und frauenfeindliche Vorurteile unhinterfragt schluckten und nachplapperten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "efdee9ef-ab0d-48b8-8472-a27b2d6f73cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "5d301dba-81ba-31db-aea9-dfb1ed5c9639",
                        "source_sense_id": "fdb065c5-744a-38e5-88f3-f2f29ece9a9c",
                        "source_sense_description": "een man die veel vrouwen verleidt",
                        "target_lang_word": "lady's man",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lady's man",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "462699eb-14c0-394a-8051-80162374f94b",
                                        "entry_id": "2086c0c1-a67a-35cd-881c-e06334dc3835",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A man who attracts women and enjoys their company."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a8d8117-6494-45f8-a7f2-bdbf5702d1d9",
                                                "sense_id": "462699eb-14c0-394a-8051-80162374f94b",
                                                "text": "This promenading was chiefly patronised by the marines, and particularly by Colbrook, a remarkably handsome and very gentlemanly corporal among them. He was a complete lady's man; with fine black eyes, bright red cheeks, glossy jet whiskers, and a refined organisation of the whole man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c845a70-1075-42cc-b77c-ef717348de72",
                                                "sense_id": "462699eb-14c0-394a-8051-80162374f94b",
                                                "text": "You know, Karen, I may not look much like a lady's man, but many a gal has cried when I left."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a4aeaa1-f4af-4a6b-b5f9-37efb32dac77",
                                                "sense_id": "462699eb-14c0-394a-8051-80162374f94b",
                                                "text": "Oh the gals won't leave me alone / I have to disconnect my phone / That's how it is when you're a lady's man"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9d06c8f-4531-3af3-a554-e8fb700272b5",
                                        "entry_id": "2086c0c1-a67a-35cd-881c-e06334dc3835",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A womanizer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54a5c779-951e-41e9-a776-a9fa3fa8bb27",
                                                "sense_id": "d9d06c8f-4531-3af3-a554-e8fb700272b5",
                                                "text": "He was the most celebrated portrait painter of his day, a notorious ladies' man, obsessed with women, pale beauties dressed in extravagant gowns . . . or nothing at all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "54b29aae-0b67-450e-a5c0-ddc6f9d8c7c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "5d301dba-81ba-31db-aea9-dfb1ed5c9639",
                        "source_sense_id": "fdb065c5-744a-38e5-88f3-f2f29ece9a9c",
                        "source_sense_description": "een man die veel vrouwen verleidt",
                        "target_lang_word": "womanizer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "womanizer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ed4c222-32bb-3d26-8829-b4ebc9ea9f2d",
                                        "entry_id": "22e85a65-8c36-3384-a08e-88fe858d2f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A man who habitually flirts with and seduces, or attempts to seduce, women."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "607858f5-b55a-4552-b886-435584250e60",
                                                "sense_id": "6ed4c222-32bb-3d26-8829-b4ebc9ea9f2d",
                                                "text": "Getting back into the dating game after a painful divorce is never easy, and the proliferation of womanizers looking to take advantage of your vulnerability only makes things worse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32c9d901-64f0-4af0-933d-8db786a6bb40",
                                                "sense_id": "6ed4c222-32bb-3d26-8829-b4ebc9ea9f2d",
                                                "text": "A couple of months ago, in a piece about the language of self-involvement, I quoted a girlfriend of Woody Allen as having described the actor as “very much of a womanizer, very self-involved”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c2a1058-de31-42a4-b874-d2e5d47d71f5",
                                                "sense_id": "6ed4c222-32bb-3d26-8829-b4ebc9ea9f2d",
                                                "text": "Sometimes the stereotype is framed as light and cheeky—think the “boys will be boys” mentality exemplified by sitcom womanizers such as How I Met Your Mothers Barney Stinson or '''Two and a Half Mens Charlie Harper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "81b3ca10-3572-4559-bfa4-08c39962f5c6",
